 forgotten to  realize the consequences of  psychological stress on your body will  come back to haunt you i got a little  depressed it was tough for me for a  minute the end of filming dropped a  heavy load of loneliness and anger that  he couldn't seem to shake off it took a  long time for him to get over those  horrible feelings and a little help from  a therapist too  number four there's excitement brewing  around the release of the batman part of  it being that we get to see a new take  on the vigilante catwoman zoe kravitz  snagged the role and she didn't take it  easy on the preparation apart from all  the intense physical training she  endured she decided it was best to study  the styles of cats and lions fighting  this helped her understand how her  character would move in a fight and how  it would mesh with her martial arts  training we did some really interesting  floor work that incorporated different  kinds of martial arts and capoeira and a  kind of feline dance-like movement  number five when news hits of an actor's  transformation social media makes sure  it hits everywhere this was the case  from a behind the scenes photo of  benedict cumberbatch getting ripped for  doctor strange too maybe a little  unnecessary for his character given he  wears a very conservative robe and cape  but could this mean he's buffing up for  his evil variant from the trailer if not  he's probably gone too far in the  multiverse  number 6. we feel like tom holland is  going to disappear if he loses any more  weight but he's willing to do anything  for the role i wanted to make sure that  i did justice to all the people who were  suffering his role in cherry transformed  him from the teen superhero to a very  dark and gritty character fresh out of  war this role required a lot of  emotional and physical demand his  dedication brought him to the extreme  lengths of fasting and running in trash  bags number seven we're back with yet  another segment on intense weight loss  david harbor edition this has been a  tough year for uh  for jeans everywhere the red guardian  roll in black widow required heavy  physical transformation and within a  very short time frame to capture the  fallen hero image in his later years  harbor asked producers to move all of  his heavy build scenes to the very top  of the schedule making it less difficult  for him to take off 60 pounds for the  flashback scenes of his character which  they ended up filming last the severe  measure he took in losing the weight  quickly involved basically starving  himself the girlfriend was not too happy  about it either  number eight kumail nanjani went big on  his first superhero role in eternals as  far as preparing for it he watched a lot  of star-studded movies because his  character kingo had blended in on earth  as a bollywood megastar non-johnny chose  to emulate the qualities of superstars  will smith and tom cruise and create a  fresh take of the two's best attributes  number nine sometimes when our favorite  actors push the boundaries too far it  negatively affects everyone around them  that was almost the case for robert  pattinson when he went to disgusting  lengths of staying in character for the  lighthouse it's absolutely ridiculous  that the whole thing doing something as  silly as spinning around before takes  and putting rocks in his shoes started  making him a little nauseous and his  only co-star william defoe was not  having it having to experience working  with an extreme method actor can prove  to be troublesome but being thrown up on  was not on defoe's itinerary his poor  character was supposed to sleep on  pattinson even while he began gagging  number 10 tom became an international  success before he was cast in the  upcoming film uncharted and he didn't  waste time in preparing for the coveted  role of bartender turned action  adventurer nathan drake he already had a  ton of action and stun experience under  his belt but bartending was not his  strong suit so holland thought it would  be a great idea to take on a bartending  job at an upscale restaurant it really  was only for a couple scenes but the  real question is how did no one  recognize him  number 11. another anticipated film  coming out soon is marvel's morbius but  all we get for now is a powerful trailer  showing jared leto's body  transformations knowing how leto can  take things a little too far with this  method we hope he didn't take it too far  with this drastic transformation number  12 like we said leto can take things a  little too far and this one was probably  the most detrimental to his health for  his role as mark chapman in the film  chapter 27 he prepared himself to gain a  lot of weight quickly he achieved his  goal but it came with very disastrous  consequences because of the quick weight  gain he developed gout towards the end  of filming it was so painful for him  that the crew had to push him around in  a wheelchair between takes  number 13 shia labeouf went to drastic  measures for his role in fury as soon as  he took the job he ran off to join the  national guard to become a chaplain you  got to start doing stuff so you believe  it and that was just some of the stuff  that i felt was needed changing his  whole lifestyle and taking on a whole  new title for a role is a little much to  say the least not to mention he pulled  out a tooth and knifed his face up we  can't even explain half the things slip  off does so we'll just leave it at that  number 14 these actors in their  disastrous diets yikes and now we fall  upon ashton kutcher's role prep for jobs  it was important for him to take care of  his representation so he changed his  diet a very unusual diet that steve jobs  himself followed in real life but eating  nothing but the same fruits and plants  is enough to make anyone get sick if  they're not used to it unfortunately for  kutcher it gave him pancreatitis twice  during the duration of filming  number 15 last but certainly not least  we get another robert pattinson gone too  far moment this was for his role in good  time but it certainly wasn't a good time  for him in preparing locking himself in  a basement and refusing to take showers  seems like the usual extreme method  actors go through but the poor costume  department had to pay for it this time  he wore his costumes from the film to  get a better feel for the character and  he never washed them isn't it a little  strange seeing the lengths actors and  actresses go through to prepare for  roles of course you have to do your  research and prepare a little but  endangering your own body and lifestyle  may go a bit too far did you think any  of these actors or actresses went a  little too far or not really at all  leave a comment below

